# Force TypeScript/source files to be treated as text so diffs render normally.
# (The Telegram bot uses UTF-8 box-drawing glyphs — ━ █ Ω — for its branded UI,
# which git's content heuristic can otherwise misclassify as binary.)
*.ts    text
*.tsx   text
*.js    text
*.rs    text
*.md    text
*.toml  text
*.yaml  text
*.yml   text
